WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:16.300
Last time: Loops · repeat 5 times: clap

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:23.520
Chapter 4 · If This, Then That

4
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:35.030
Today: Robo learns to make choices!

5
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:46.100
Monday morning. Aarav is ready for school

6
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:54.470
Should Aarav take the umbrella?

7
00:00:54.470 --> 00:01:07.170
It depends! First, he checks the weather

8
00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:18.000
If it rains, then take an umbrella

9
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:26.940
IF something is true → THEN do this

10
00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:39.310
Condition = the thing you check · true or not

11
00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:51.030
THEN happens only when the condition is true

12
00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:57.950
What about a sunny day?

13
00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:16.880
ELSE = otherwise · leave the umbrella at home

14
00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:28.270
A branch: one way OR the other, never both

15
00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:39.860
Raju bhaiya checks the traffic light

16
00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:51.070
If red → stop. Else → go carefully

17
00:02:51.070 --> 00:03:00.230
The light is green. Stop or go?

18
00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:11.750
Green is not red → the ELSE part: go!

19
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:20.950
If Aarav is hungry, then he eats his tiffin

20
00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:35.660
If the bell rings, then go to class

21
00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:53.960
Homework done? Cricket! Else, homework first

22
00:03:53.960 --> 00:04:10.770
Which one is an if-then rule?

23
00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:22.880
It checks something, then says what to do

24
00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:35.870
If I'm sleepy, then ___. Else ___.

25
00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:46.650
Then: go to bed. Else: read one more story

26
00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:53.080
Game characters follow if-then rules too!

27
00:04:53.080 --> 00:05:09.710
If lives = 0 → Game over. Else → keep playing

28
00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:22.450
The game checks the rule again and again

29
00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:31.820
2 lives left. Game over, or keep playing?

30
00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:39.730
2 is not 0 → else → keep playing!

31
00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:45.000
Your turn: practice check

32
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:57.760
If the light is red, then ___. Else ___.

33
00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:10.800
If red, then stop. Else, go carefully.

34
00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:17.700
IF = check a condition

35
00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:22.150
THEN = what to do if it's true

36
00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:27.320
ELSE = what to do if it's not

37
00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:32.890
Red light → stop. Else → go

38
00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:40.820
Chapter 4 done!

39
00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:47.620
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
